sample_Agent_remote_job = {'Company_Name': ['Tech Innovations Inc.'], 'Location': ['San Francisco, CA'], 'Email_Address': ['careers@techinnovations.com'], 'Description': ['Lead Data Engineer role specializing in cloud-based scalable data solutions.', 'The ideal candidate will have extensive experience in data engineering with a focus on designing and implementing complex data pipelines using Python, Spark, and Kafka. Familiarity with Docker and Kubernetes for container orchestration, as well as cloud platforms like AWS and Azure, is required.', 'The candidate should have a proficiency in leveraging Databricks for advanced analytics and data processing. Experience with backend frameworks such as Flask, Django, and FastAPI is a plus, as is familiarity with Redis for caching and message brokering.', 'Responsibilities include leading a team of engineers to design, build, and maintain data infrastructure, ensuring reliability and performance across all data services, and collaborating closely with product and development teams to integrate data insights.', 'Applicants are expected to demonstrate a minimum of 12 years of experience in the relevant technologies. Excellent communication skills and a passion for driving technological innovation are essential.']}